WEBVTT

00:27:55.871 --> 00:28:01.454
generous life, you know, light filled
person, maybe I can be the junk,

00:28:01.746 --> 00:28:05.579
the pile of shit, the darkness that
my father nurtured in me.

00:28:06.413 --> 00:28:12.454
There was something that I had to figure
out about those primal relationships.

00:28:13.788 --> 00:28:16.163
That I had to rage against and he'll.

00:28:17.163 --> 00:28:24.871
And understand and revise, and I think
that a lot of us have to do that,

00:28:25.163 --> 00:28:27.829
you know, I think that a lot
of people who are suffering

00:28:27.829 --> 00:28:31.038
and certainly people who have written
to me as sugar, you know,